From 62c86ba44f18d67a9b124aecdb432495c99d3d82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Playport contributors <playport@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:52:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: allocate guest-constrained VM in owner-local gaps

Share window gap search with images, apply zero-bits and image limits to guest offsets, and support NULL commit/reserve and top-down placement without capturing unconstrained native allocations. Bootstrap parameters use this path. Keep raw guest conversion and the native loader closed.

Class: feature
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-03-portal2-wine-window.md
Offered-upstream: no (iOS pseudo-process window port)
